Chapter: LinearMintDrop

 A minted linear owner that is never used is a leaked resource. The
 checker must reject the drop exactly as it rejects an unused linear
 parameter.

Section: Defs

  bus-acquire : Integer -> linear Integer
  bus-acquire (n) = n

  drop-grant : Integer -> Integer
  drop-grant (n) =
   let g = bus-acquire n
   in n + 1

Section: Entry

  opening : Integer
  opening = drop-grant 7
